PE 916: Restricted Permutations / 有限制排列

P(n) = count of permutations of {1..2n} with
  LIS ≤ n+1 and LDS ≤ 2

RSK: shape λ with |λ|=2n, λ₁≤n+1, ℓ(λ)≤2
P(n) = Σ (f^λ)² over valid λ

Testing P(2): 13 (expected 13)
Testing P(10) mod MOD: 45265702 (expected 45265702)

Computing P(10^8)... (this may be slow)
Note: O(n) algorithm too slow for n=10^8.
